# The .NET images (Smx.Backend, Smx.Orchestrator) use this whole `src/` tree as their build
# context. Without this file, `az acr build` uploads every bin/obj/node_modules folder too —
# hundreds of MB of build output that the multi-stage Dockerfiles restore fresh anyway. Excluding
# them here keeps the context upload to just source. (The frontend has its own smx-web/.dockerignore.)
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/.vs/
